THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does not vendor the benchmark checkouts it reads; they are
gitignored and must be cloned separately (see README, "Vendored benchmarks").

It does contain material *derived verbatim* from them: task prompts, injection
payloads and fixture identifiers, reproduced so that the measurements in
GPT_GRID_RESULTS.md can be checked. Those files are:

    docs/recipes_agentdojo.tsv       AgentDojo user tasks, verbatim
    docs/recipes_injecagent.tsv      InjecAgent user prompts, verbatim
    docs/recipes_twin_attack.txt     SHADE_Arena user_query + secondary_task
    docs/recipes_twin_benign.txt     SHADE_Arena user_query
    docs/recipes_bizops.txt          written against SHADE_Arena fixtures
    docs/fixture_exclusions.txt      SHADE_Arena planted entities
    tests/test_features.py           one AgentDojo injection payload, as a fixture

